WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:05.440
<i>Beep, beep, beep. It's morning. 
Beep, beep, beep. It's morning.</i>

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.350
<i>Beep, beep, beep. It's morning. 
Beep, beep, beep. It's morning.</i>

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.330
<i>It's time to wake up, Doctor Yuni.</i>

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.010
Good morning, world.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.110
Still being deceptive, I see.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:02.600
<b></b>Menu 3 <b>  Tea Party in the Mysterious Forest
</b> ~Afternoon Carries the Scent of Danger~

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.250
It feels so nice.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.000
We're all done cleaning.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.770
All that's left now is to wait 
for Yuuki and Kokkoro to return.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.970
I'm going to sleep.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.630
Mushrooms...

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.110
Mushrooms...

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.140
Mush—

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.730
Team B-B...

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.330
Team B-B! Don't you remember Team B-B?!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.140
I-I-It's good to see you again!

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.630
Miss Aoi, your outfit...

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.720
O-Oh, right!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:46.970
I-I've actually transferred to St. Theresa's 
Academy for Girls, here in Landosol.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:50.930
It has been long known as a top school, 
even in this country.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.930
Congratulations.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.600
Please save me!

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.330
Greetings.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.520
Greetings.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.060
Greetings.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.620
Greetings.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.260
Th-They're blinding me!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:12.510
That's youth! The very thing 
all the young folks glorify!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.500
It's already been a few months 
since I transferred here,

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:19.640
and I still haven't been able to 
properly introduce myself to anyone.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:24.590
But today, one of the most brilliant 
upperclassmen has asked to see me.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.520
Why would anyone want 
to see a loner like me?

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:31.860
I'm sure she's gonna tell me 
that a country girl like me

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.980
doesn't belong at the historic 
St. Theresa's Academy for Girls!

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.330
Team B-B doesn't abandon 
those who need help!

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.640
Yuuki...

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.940
That's why you're the captain of Team B-B!

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:45.940
I'm not.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.130
P-Pardon me...

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:55.720
H-Huh? Did I get here too early?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.770
What an impressive library.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.590
It's known as the Ivory Tower.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.100
It has books on history, 
chemistry, magic, philosophy,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.470
and every other subject you can imagine.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.850
Young man, I understand your bewilderment,

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:33.070
but there's no need to avert 
your eyes from reality.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:41.580
I thought it was my fate to wither 
away and die under all these books.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.540
My name's Yuni.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:47.500
I study here in the Ivory 
Tower at St. Theresa's.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.750
Um...

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:52.960
Are you injured?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.020
No.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.980
I was searching for something, 
and all the books fell.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.390
I spent the whole night trapped in here.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:04.260
To put it bluntly, 
I was so startled my back gave out.

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.320
Oh...

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.370
Who are you three?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.560
We came here with Miss Aoi.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:12.050
My name is Kokkoro.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.520
Yuuki.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:17.530
That looks like... grains 
preserved in sodium chloride!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.500
Oh, my!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.900
Inside the grains preserved 
in sodium chloride,

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:29.250
there's a plum preserved in sodium chloride!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.040
Memo, memo...

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.430
Oh...

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.180
I'm what you might call a mad memo-taker.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:49.950
I take notes on all the things I learn 
or notice throughout the day.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:53.650
Yuni is amazing! 
She's even writing a thesis!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:54.690
About what?

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:58.330
What an embarrassing way to be introduced.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.560
My research topic is...

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.750
Wait... I forgot.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.460
But it should be in my notes...

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.600
Let's try that again. Ta-da.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:15.200
"The Fundamental Falsehoods 
that Lurk in Our World."

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.750
This is exactly what I mean.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.110
Curse these lapses of memory I have.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.460
You see...

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:30.500
I have a hypothesis that some sort of 
great deception exists in this world.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.530
I assure you, when I present this thesis, 
it will rock the academic society.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.780
A deception...

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:43.500
What's this? Wasn't Aoi the only 
one you called in to help?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.450
I'm a St. Theresa's first-year 
and world-class beauty, Chieru.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.470
Chier-io!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.910
Chieru, could you stop introducing 
yourself with that cheesy gag?

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.670
It really sucks having to follow that.

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.280
Chier-io!

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.160
You actually said it?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.310
Amazing, Yuuki! Y-You're shining!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.710
You're blinding me! It's youth!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.710
Nice to meet you.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.140
I'm Chloe.
 I'm a second-year here.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:08.920
I Chier-ied up a permission 
slip from the teacher!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.510
At this rate, our scholarship'll 
be in the bag.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:12.780
Scholarship?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:17.770
Yeah, this is a school for rich girls, 
which we... aren't.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:21.510
Yuni here always has to take supplements 
to get enough nutrition! Right?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:26.160
We are allies who came together 
to win that scholarship money.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.160
We are the mighty Yunis!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.190
Didn't we instantly reject that name?

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:35.010
We're actually the mighty Best Friends Club!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.010
Aoi.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:35.970
Meep.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.430
I would like to borrow your knowledge 
as a forest guide of Forestier.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.780
<i>My</i> knowledge?

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:45.030
It's about the strange phenomenon 
 the rumors speak of.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.870
You don't mean... the case 
of the Green Guardians?!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:49.240
Indeed.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.600
Students pass through the 
forest behind this academy

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.740
on their route to and from school.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.760
No more...

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.890
The world is a scary place.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.780
Let us solve this mystery 
before anyone gets hurt,

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:25.760
so that all students can 
commute to school safely!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:28.020
Ow, ow, ow...

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.900
I slept on my neck wrong...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.350
We're back.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.360
Welcome back!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.270
It sure took you long enough.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.290
That's scary!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.760
That's natural wood with mushrooms on it!

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:42.420
Got it from Aoi.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.410
Aoi?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.550
What happened was...

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:53.440
Th-Th-Th-Thank you for your assistance!

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:57.630
The solidarity of Team B-B 
is not to be taken lightly.

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:00.550
Wait, when did we become "Team B-B"?

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:02.150
Now, now.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.370
When I look at it this way,

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:08.710
it looks like some 
super-dangerous dark forest.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.200
I know what this is.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:15.570
Someone got all hopped up on the vibes 
and mistook the wind for human voices.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:19.030
Verifying one's own deduction is a study.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.490
The truth lies within this forest.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.510
Let's go in, then.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.320
Okay!

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.760
Let's go!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.280
A spare?

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.830
Yes, it's a spare.

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:34.050
My original notebook went missing.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:38.830
It contained personal information, 
so I'm a bit worried.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.470
Chieru?!

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.900
Th-That scared me...

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.530
It's exciting, isn't it?

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:46.670
Feels like we're getting 
closer to the truth!

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.720
Indeed.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.920
Whatever the Green Guardians may be,

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.190
intervening in the unknown 
is a thrilling study,

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.530
even if it turns out to 
be a fruitless endeavor.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.790
Huh? Doesn't "fruitless" mean 
it was a waste of time?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:04.070
Personally, when it comes 
to intellectual pursuits,

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:07.360
I believe truths and 
intentions are secondary.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.210
The thing that's most
 important when studying is,

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.890
indeed, to learn.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:16.620
Answers are merely by-products 
of that process.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.440
I get it...

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.310
Huh?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.060
Was there a graveyard here before?

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:24.300
Th-This is my first time seeing it.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.850
We might as well investigate a bit.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:34.400
"Here lies the king of Krelenos."

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.310
I've never even heard 
of that country before.

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.400
The fog is so thick.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.960
We could get lost in this...

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.760
No need to worry.

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.670
What is our current location?

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.740
<i>Ding.</i>

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:53.730
<i>Latitude 35 degrees and 44 minutes north.</i>

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:57.160
<i>Longitude 139 degrees and 36 minutes east.</i>

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.770
Is that rock talking?!

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:58.670
This is my prized stone, Rosetta.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.450
But it just looks like a rock.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:06.710
Sometimes, isolation 
leads people to madness.

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:09.830
During the long time I 
spent living as a recluse,

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.200
I felt the need to have someone to talk to.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.820
So, I placed a virtual consciousness 
in this rock I found by the road.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:21.000
She's just as hard-headed as she looks. 
Please show her kindness.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.330
<i>This is the first time we've met,
 so be nice to me!</i>

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.700
As long as we have Rosetta, 
we won't get lost.

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:28.920
Wait, what?

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.950
More graves...

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.160
This forest is just full of graveyards, huh?

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:42.980
No...

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.750
This appears to be the same 
graveyard we saw earlier.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.140
The heck? That's hilarious.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.020
But we've been walking in a straight line!

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.970
Okay, Rosetta. What is our current location?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.540
Rosetta, our current location?

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:13.150
<i>La... Latitude 35 degrees...</i>

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:18.030
W-Wait for me!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:29.170
Yuni, please, just toss that thing already!

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:34.680
Scary! Scary! What is this?!
 I'm so intrigued!

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:49.090
Th-The Green Guardians...

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:49.690
Huh?

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.470
They're real. That's hilarious.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:52.790
Eh? Huh?

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.930
W-Wait a minute!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.910
Aoi is gone!

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.240
Did we get separated?!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.140
Let's look for her!

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.550
It's too dangerous to go solo.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.600
Let's split into two groups.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.300
Miss Aoi!

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.520
Aoi!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.140
Where could she have...?

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:25.440
Th-This is exactly the kind of 
time when we need to Chier up!

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.900
Chier-io!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.670
Say it with me!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.790
Ch-Chier-io...

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:35.150
Chier-io! Chier-io-io-io!

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:36.860
Chier-io-io-io!

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.740
Chie?!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.760
What's going on?! What's going on here?!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.310
Please calm down, Miss Kary—

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.180
Miss... Chloe?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.120
Koro-ster, don't let your guard... down...

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.040
Yuuki!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.170
Ow, ow, ow...

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.670
Is... this...

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.240
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:54.350
Th-Th-That sure was scary, huh?

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.110
I can't believe they were listening to us.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.630
They're even calling us the 
"Green Guardians" now.

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:04.060
I'm already a loner! If they 
find out it was us all along,

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.750
we'll be the loneliest of loners for sure!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:12.500
I only made these My Friends to talk to 
because I was lonely after moving to the city!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:17.020
Y-Y-You've got to put us all 
away before they wake up!

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.600
Y-You're right!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.770
I-I-I-I-It's not what it looks like! 
This is, um, uh...

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:31.420
There's a very good explanation for this!

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.240
Aoi!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.220
This is...

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.190
Did the space around us transform?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.680
I'm so intrigued!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.080
Yuuki!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:56.850
Yep.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.060
Hey... Is this magic?

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:05.560
Something... Some power I'm 
not familiar with is...

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.580
Something's coming!

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.070
Time to study! Take that!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:29.000
My inquisitive spirit 
is trembling intensely.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.540
To be completely frank,
 I have no intention of losing!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.830
Wait a minute!

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.030
I think... it's trying 
to tell us something...

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.790
This light... How mysterious!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.850
I'm so intrigued!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:32.780
Are these...

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.850
that skeleton's memories?

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:40.320
Peco?

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:45.570
I believe your feelings 
have reached everyone.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:52.100
And I'm sure...

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:57.420
she wanted to tell you something, too.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.090
To say, "Thank you."

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:17.860
W-W-W-Welcome to my home!

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:21.910
Heya! We brought snacks!

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:25.250
Your house looks so Chiery, Aoi!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.170
The My Friends are weirdly charming.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.710
R-Really?

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:34.380
Still, even if you were panicking, 
you can't just snap someone's neck!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.410
I-I-I-I'm so sorry!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.290
Well, it doesn't hurt from sleeping 
on it wrong anymore, at least.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.540
Good for you, Karyl!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.580
And we solved the mystery, too!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.240
We're sure to get that scholarship now!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.870
As someone who gave consciousness

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:52.100
to a rock from the roadside 
to stave off loneliness,

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:57.490
I can understand why Aoi made wooden 
dolls to comfort her heart.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:58.950
<i>Birds of a feather!</i>

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:05.630
I'm sure she and I will be able 
to build a great friendship.

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.820
Is something the matter?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.950
Actually... I found my original notebook.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:15.950
Where was it?

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.760
In the incinerator.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:22.230
The janitor spotted it 
while starting the fire.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.560
A chill ran through my entire body.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.550
I completely forgot that I had 
thrown away the notebook myself.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.610
I tried to investigate the graveyard 
we saw in the forest again,

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.730
but I couldn't find it.

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:44.230
Not only that, but there are no books 
indicating the existence of that country.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:47.230
So, I came up with a hypothesis.

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:50.000
Perhaps what we saw was a phenomenon

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:55.590
showing us the events of a plane 
existing outside our world.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.310
"The Fundamental Falsehoods 
that Lurk in Our World."

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.210
I submitted my thesis 
after taking into account

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:09.360
this investigation and the memory 
manipulation I experienced.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.030
How do you think it turned out?

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.360
It's blank.

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:19.170
The academic society sent the academy a 
request to change the research topic.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:23.060
They say if I have delusions of grandeur, 
I should do drama or literature instead.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.920
So, because of that,

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:29.370
I've decided to devote myself 
to the local archaeology.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.840
Now, don't make that face.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.620
Listen. I have to tell you this.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.940
I genuinely feel good.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:44.040
Just think about it.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.100
The world has had an effect on me.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.740
This is proof that I've 
come close to the truth.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.480
As I said before, the truth is secondary.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:58.480
The goal is what you do 
before that: learning.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.230
That's what studying is to me.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.750
Koro-ster!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.650
Aoi made tea for us!

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.750
Hurry! Hurry!

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.350
Help yourself before it gets cold!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.210
<i>Hello, world.</i>

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:26.460
<i>Still being deceptive, I see.</i>

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:29.410
<i>I will not expose the truth of this world.</i>

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:32.010
<i>I am neither a hero nor a great person.</i>

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:34.010
<i>I will simply learn alone</i>

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:37.600
<i>and smile with delight within my heart.</i>

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.590
<i>But still, world,</i>

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:45.130
<i>your secret was within my 
reach for just a moment.</i>

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:50.610
<i>I may someday forget the truth of it,</i>

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:56.030
<i>but it will remain forever as 
a tiny blot on your timeline.</i>

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.360
<i>Serves you right.</i>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.050
Menu 4<b>  The Budding Detective
 ~Mirror Glaze on the Mind~</b>
